    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="30.3b">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 30.3b</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gyf he ðonne ful wurðe, æt ðam forman cyrre bete ðam teonde twygylde ⁊ ðam hlaford his wér ðe his wites wyrðe sy ⁊ sette getreowe borgas, þæt he ælces yfeles geswice.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if then he (the accused) is proved guilty, on the first occasion he shall pay double value to the accuser and his wergeld to the lord who is entitled to receive his fine, and he shall appoint trustworthy sureties, that henceforth he will desist from all wrong-doing.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">And gif he þonne fúl weorðe, æt ðam forman cyrre bete ðam teonde twygylde ⁊ þam hlaforde his wer, þe his wites wyrðe sig, ⁊ sette getrywe borgas, þæt he ælces yfeles eft geswice.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
